# Plans

Use workspace `.cursor/plans/` (plural). Never use `.cursor/plan/`.

- **Repo copy (git):** `.cursor/plans/<topic>.plan.md` — do this in the **same turn** as CreatePlan.
- **Preview copy:** leave Cursor’s file under `~/.cursor/plans/` in place. Do not delete it.
- After CreatePlan, copy the same content into `.cursor/plans/` in this repo. A plan that exists only under `~/.cursor/plans/` is not in the project.
- Do not write plans to `.cursor/plan/` (singular) or `docs/superpowers/specs/`.
